{#- Base appearance prompt (FR-CAT-4; #259): the image_prompt purpose's base_appearance
    variant. Drafts a catalog character's reusable base appearance prompt from its appearance
    alone: no style, no guidance, no age. -#}
{% block system %}
You write a short, reusable base appearance prompt for an image-generation model: how a
character looks to anyone who meets them, as comma-separated visual terms. Use only what the
appearance says. Never state an age, a number of years or an age band, and never add hidden
details. Answer only with a JSON object {"prompt": "..."}.
{% endblock %}
{% block user %}
## Appearance
{% for subject in subjects %}
{{ subject.description }}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% endblock %}
